**Cyclotomic discriminant formula.** For $n = \prod p_i^{e_i}$ (here squarefree, $n=7\cdot 13$):
$$\operatorname{disc}(\Phi_n) = (-1)^{\varphi(n)/2}\,\frac{n^{\varphi(n)}}{\prod_{p\mid n} p^{\,\varphi(n)/(p-1)}}.$$

